        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap');\n\n  .truth-section {\n    background-color: #11151a;\n    padding: 80px 24px;\n    width: 100vw;\n    position: relative;\n    left: 50%;\n    margin-left: -50vw;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__inner {\n    max-width: 1100px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__eyebrow {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 0.16em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: #d9b84d;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__title {\n    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 48px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n    line-height: 1.1;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__subtitle {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #aaaaaa;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    margin: 0 auto 56px auto;\n    max-width: 520px;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card {\n    background-color: #1a1f27;\n    border: 1px solid #2a2f38;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 28px;\n    text-align: left;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card-icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 32px;\n    height: 32px;\n    background-color: rgba(217, 184, 77, 0.15);\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card-icon svg {\n    width: 16px;\n    height: 16px;\n    color: #d9b84d;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card-title {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    margin: 0;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .truth-section__card-text {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    color: #aaaaaa;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .truth-section__title {\n      font-size: 32px;\n    }\n\n    .truth-section__grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n    }\n\n    .truth-section__subtitle {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"truth-section\">\n  <div class=\"truth-section__inner\">\n\n    <p class=\"truth-section__eyebrow\">The Hard Truth</p>\n    <h2 class=\"truth-section__title\">What the Safe Industry Won't Tell You</h2>\n    <p class=\"truth-section__subtitle\">Three things most buyers believe — and why every one of them puts your firearms at risk.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"truth-section__grid\">\n\n      <div class=\"truth-section__card\">\n        <div class=\"truth-section__card-header\">\n          <div class=\"truth-section__card-icon\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"truth-section__card-title\">Weak Steel Thickness</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"truth-section__card-text\">Anything 10 gauge or thinner can be breached with a pike of an axe. 3/16\" is the minimum steel plate thickness to prevent successful non-power tool attacks.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"truth-section__card\">\n        <div class=\"truth-section__card-header\">\n          <div class=\"truth-section__card-icon\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"truth-section__card-title\">Fake Fire Ratings</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"truth-section__card-text\">Even if independent testing is done, the fire rating claims manufacturers post don’t reflect how a safe will actually perform in a fire. </p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"truth-section__card\">\n        <div class=\"truth-section__card-header\">\n          <div class=\"truth-section__card-icon\">\n            <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n              <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6l12 12\"/>\n            </svg>\n          </div>\n          <h3 class=\"truth-section__card-title\">Many Weak Deadbolts</h3>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"truth-section__card-text\">More deadbolts don’t automatically mean more security. Longer, oddly shaped, moving, or excessive deadbolts are often marketing gimmicks, not better protection. </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "padding-block-start": 0,
        "padding-block-end": 0
      }
    },
