        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Anton&display=swap');\n\n  .faq-home-section {\n    background-color: #11151a;\n    padding: 60px 24px;\n    width: 100vw;\n    position: relative;\n    left: 50%;\n    margin-left: -50vw;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__inner {\n    max-width: 900px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__title {\n    font-family: 'Anton', sans-serif;\n    font-size: 36px;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    margin: 0 0 40px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 0.01em;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__list {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    border-top: 1px solid #2a2f38;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2f38;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__question {\n    width: 100%;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 24px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 16px;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__question-text {\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__icon {\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n    width: 20px;\n    height: 20px;\n    color: #d4af37;\n    transition: transform 0.3s ease;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__item.is-open .faq-home-section__icon {\n    transform: rotate(45deg);\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__answer {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.4s ease;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__item.is-open .faq-home-section__answer {\n    max-height: 600px;\n  }\n\n  .faq-home-section__answer-inner {\n    padding: 0 0 24px 0;\n    font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #aaaaaa;\n    line-height: 1.8;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .faq-home-section__title {\n      font-size: 26px;\n    }\n\n    .faq-home-section__question-text {\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .faq-home-section__answer-inner {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .faq-home-section__question {\n      padding: 20px 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<div class=\"faq-home-section\">\n  <div class=\"faq-home-section__inner\">\n\n    <h2 class=\"faq-home-section__title\">Common questions before you buy</h2>\n\n    <div class=\"faq-home-section__list\">\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">How thick is the steel on a Sturdy Gun Safe?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">Our Heavy Duty line starts at .22 inches (4 gauge) for the body and 3/8 inch for the door plate — nearly twice the thickness of most comparably priced safes. Our Essential line uses 3/16 inch (7 gauge) body steel, which is thicker than most competitors' flagship models. If a manufacturer will not disclose the gauge, that tells you something.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">What fire insulation does Sturdy use?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">We use 2.5 inches of ceramic wool rated to 2,300°F — the same insulation material used in industrial kilns, glass furnaces, and jet engine testing facilities. It does not crumble. It does not release moisture. Most other manufacturers use fire board, which is basically drywall, and that isn't a real insulator.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">Where are Sturdy Safes manufactured?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">Every safe is built by hand in our facility in Fresno, California using American A36 to grade 50 steel. We have never outsourced manufacturing, never imported steel, and never changed our construction methods in over 60 years.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">Can I customize my safe?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">Yes. We build every safe to order and offer custom sizes, interior configurations, and finish options. Call 800-262-0023 to discuss your needs.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">How long does delivery take?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">Most safes ship within 2–6 weeks from our Fresno facility. Delivery is curbside via freight carrier. We can also connect you with local movers for in-home installation.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">What's the return policy?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">30 days, full refund, return shipping included. We're the only manufacturer that offers this because we know you'll keep it.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"faq-home-section__item\">\n        <button class=\"faq-home-section__question\">\n          <span class=\"faq-home-section__question-text\">Should I get a mechanical dial or electronic lock?</span>\n          <svg class=\"faq-home-section__icon\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\">\n            <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M12 4.5v15m7.5-7.5h-15\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"faq-home-section__answer\">\n          <p class=\"faq-home-section__answer-inner\">Both use Sargent & Greenleaf — the lock brand specified in US government security contracts. Mechanical dials have no battery to fail, allow unlimited attempts, and last indefinitely. We warranty them to do so. The Electronic locks we offer provide faster access, and longer lifespan... for an electronic. </p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n  document.querySelectorAll('.faq-home-section__question').forEach(button => {\n    button.addEventListener('click', () => {\n      const item = button.closest('.faq-home-section__item');\n      const isOpen = item.classList.contains('is-open');\n\n      document.querySelectorAll('.faq-home-section__item.is-open').forEach(open => {\n        open.classList.remove('is-open');\n      });\n\n      if (!isOpen) {\n        item.classList.add('is-open');\n      }\n    });\n  });\n</script>",
